stop thinking about it  i know and and you know just that day  alone  you know we wake up and we see that he  has moved on to the next place  and then later on we see that randall  keenan who was a phenomenal writer and  person  and huge heart had also moved on to the  next place and for me  i wanted to just go back to bed and then  the more i read about what um  chadwick had done and how he had done it  through his illness  and colon cancer is a very painful  illness  and the fact that he he had pushed  through it  to to create this enormous change in the  world i mean what  young kid doesn't think about the black  panther or jackie robinson  or thurgood marshall and see some future  self um  so i mean you know black panther not so  did you think let me get out what i mean  did you think jackie let me get up yeah  i was like there is no reason for me to  try to go back to bed i got work to do  if the ancestors could do it i can do it  too yes we all have work to do on many  different things jacqueline woodson  thank you so much for taking the time i  really appreciate it  before the ever after is on sale now  wherever you like to buy your books

